# GuardFixed (30040), a town guard of Gludio: a hit of 10 makes it hate the character by
# 2000 and want to attack it, from its post (GuardFixed's attacked hook, which never calls
# Guard's). GuardMoveAroundFixed's 5-minute return draws its spawn point, which an npc
# line without a maker does not have; tests/ai/guard_fixed_test.go covers it.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Guard.Guard
script script.ai.individual.Guard.GuardFixed
script script.ai.individual.Guard.GuardMoveAround
script script.ai.individual.Guard.GuardMoveAroundFixed
script script.ai.individual.Guard.GuardStand
npc post 30040 Guard 300 0 0

hit post 10
  hate post 2000
  desires post attack(player)=2000
